<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Chiquita Brands rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Chiquita Brands rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz analyst Teresa Garza started coverage of Chiquita Brands International Inc with a buy rating on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- In a research report entitled &quot;Time to Go Bananas,&quot; Garza gave the stock a 52-week price target range of $18 to $20, which she called conservative, excluding potential benefits from likely reform to the European Union quota system.</p>
<p>-- expects Chiquita to earn $0.96 a share in fiscal 1997 and $1.31 in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares up 3/16 to 14-7/16 at midday.</p>
</text>
